## Model card

- **Name:** Owl Alpha (stealth → revealed as LongCat-2.0)
- **Short description:** A stealth model served on OpenRouter from 2026-04-28 with a ~1M-token context, native tool use and text-only I/O. Independent stealth tracking identifies it as **LongCat-2.0** (Meituan, MIT-licensed MoE weights).
- **Provider / access:** OpenRouter stealth route (`openrouter/owl-alpha`); no first-party ID.
- **Release / knowledge:** 2026-04-28 (stealth listing); knowledge cutoff not published.
- **IDs:** `owl-alpha`, `openrouter/owl-alpha`; revealed target `longcat-2.0`.
- **Context window:** 1,048,756 tokens (benchable) — ~1M.
- **Modalities:** text in / text out; tool and function calling (no multimodal support).
- **Pricing (as of 2026-11-11/12):** stealth preview, no per-token rate published.
- **Architecture:** per the reveal, LongCat-2.0's MIT-licensed MoE with sparse attention and 1M context.

